<p>Dear <%= @first_name %>,</p>

<% if @document_name %>
  <p>Great news! <%= @child_first_name %> has completed their portion of "<%= @document_name %>" for <%= @event_name %>. Now we need your signature on it.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>Great news! <%= @child_first_name %> has completed their portion of the waiver for <%= @event_name %>. Now we need your signature on this waiver.</p>
<% end %>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button(@document_name ? "Sign the document" : "Sign the Waiver", @waiver_link) %>
</p>

<% if @waiver_is_final_task %>
  <p>Once you've signed, we'll process the completed <%= @document_name ? "document" : "waiver" %> and confirm <%= @child_first_name %>'s registration.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>After you sign, any remaining steps will stay visible on <%= @child_first_name %>'s dashboard.</p>
<% end %>

<p>If you have any questions, don't hesitate to email us at <%= mail_to @support_email %>, or just hit reply to this email!</p>
